id: full-power-super-saiyan-legendary-super-saiyan
name: Legendary Super Saiyan
order: 3
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: super-saiyan-style-traits
groupLabel: Super Saiyan Style Traits
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 2
# (2): the Legendary Evolved Stage on this Form, its Stress Test Requirement 3 lower (transformations.mjs stressTakenOff).
stressForOn: legendary-evolved 3
description: >
  Clad in a blaze of legendary power, you represent the pinnacle of evolution for the Super Saiyan Transformation.
text: >
  Legendary Super Saiyan: Clad in a blaze of legendary power, you represent the pinnacle of evolution for the Super Saiyan Transformation.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Legendary Saiyan Factor Trait.
  (2)-[Permanent]: Reduce the Stress Test Requirement of the Legendary Evolved Stage with this Transformation as its Original Form by 3.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Might by 1(T).

---

# (2) Legendary's Stress Test Requirement 3 lower on this Form - its header.

# (3) Might 1(T).
[passive, effect 3]
might += 1(T);
